> inside a box (not that I know of anyway.  Does anyone have a method?).

Elimination after identifying the other grey stones; destroying the
box (by force, or enlisting the help of a passing gelcube), then
applying the tests for loadstones outside boxes; wishing for an
uncursed loadstone and naming its type.

